From 3665b099942b6b583a799392fd2e2917bc577213 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: =?UTF-8?q?Niccol=C3=B2=20Venerandi?= <niccolo@venerandi.com>
Date: Thu, 26 Nov 2026 22:16:22 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] applet: show the streams of an application as one item

Apps that play several streams at once got one slider per stream, so
changing an app's volume meant moving each of them. Streams are now
grouped by application, and the group can be expanded to show each one.

BUG: 385485
